# Hold the PROBE screen's run button once ferrum offers it (its readiness
# line is empty: on, homed, idle, the right tool; and not busy writing its
# probe defaults, which it does 3 s after things go still), then wait until
# it has finished the routine, restore lines included, and it did not fail.
wait prop.pr-running == false within 30
wait prop.pr-ready == "" within 30
do probe-run
wait prop.pr-running == true within 10
wait prop.pr-running == false within 300
idle 30
expect prop.pr-result !contains failed
